 <h3><u>Ye kafela layja</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Ye kafela layja</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Ale nabi ka kafela, jab shaam ko chala. </font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Kehne lagi hussain se. </p> <p>Hamshir alvidaa. </p> <p>Ane lagi ik lashaye be sar se ye sadaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Maine basayi karbala) x3</p> <p>Tu shaam ko basaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>1. Kuch gham na kar jo raah me sehne hai sakhtiya</p> <p>Sajaad mera kafele ka honga sarwan</p> <p>(neze pe tere saath hi) x3</p> <p>jayenga sar mera</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>2. Shiri ka ghar bhi raah me aayenga ay bahan</p> <p>Tujko agar pehchan na paye wo purmehen</p> <p>(kehna ke pura hogaya) x3</p> <p>waada ye gham zadaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>3. Ay zainab teri raah me ayenga ek makaam</p> <p>Hatim bulaayenga wahaa le le ke sabkaa naam</p> <p>(karna wahaa bhi sabr tu) x3</p> <p>karna na bad duwaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>4. Aysi bhi manzil raah me ayengi nawha ghar</p> <p>Uthegi teri simt jo na paak har nazar</p> <p>(quraan sunayenga wahi) x3</p> <p>neze pe sar mera</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>5. ek aysi basti ayengi kuch pehle shaam se</p> <p>takseem hongi chaadare rahib ki naam se</p> <p>(phir chinlenge chaadare) x3</p> <p>aakar wo ashkiya</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>6. Ay behna tera raah me hoga ye haal bhi</p> <p>Bache judaa hojayenge jismo se khaal bhi</p> <p>(har ghaam tere haal pe) x3</p> <p>rowengi sayidaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>7. Ja zainab ja abaad kar zindaane shaam ko</p> <p>Zainab sulaadena wahi us tishna kaam ko</p> <p>(jiske gohar bhi chingaye) x3</p> <p>Daman bhi hai jalaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>8. Shahzadi meri shaam se aye jo karbala</p> <p>Kartithi apne bhayi ki markad pe ye buka</p> <p>(zindaan basaa ke aagayi) x3</p> <p>tumne jo ye kahaa</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>(Ye kafela layja zainab, kafela layja) x2</p></font>
